1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,340
A bowling alley, a casino, and a golf course, all at one Punta Cana all-inclusive.

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:08,705
This is Barceló Bávaro Palace, on Bávaro Beach.

3
00:00:08,755 --> 00:00:12,800
Start on a private beach where a coral reef keeps the water calm.

4
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:16,490
Cool off in one of four pools, with four poolside bars.

5
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:21,1000
Dinner? The hotel lists eleven restaurants, from Italian to Japanese to a steak house.

6
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:24,785
Then hit the bowling alley, the spa, or the nightclub.

7
00:00:24,835 --> 00:00:27,485
The Lakes golf course is a ten minute walk away.

8
00:00:27,535 --> 00:00:35,020
Over six thousand verified reviews give it eight point two out of ten. The full tour is on my channel.
